# Committed production build config.
#
# A GA4 measurement ID is not a secret — it is visible in the page source of
# any site running gtag.js, and it only identifies the property to send to.
# Committing it means git-triggered Cloudflare builds produce a site with
# analytics, rather than silently dropping it when a dashboard variable is
# missing. Override locally in .env (gitignored) to point a build elsewhere.
VITE_GA4_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-G8BSJ01RFD
